  "location": "MAR22.23 HBR; MAR22.44 HBR_ctp",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: MAR22.23 HBR; MAR22.44 HBR_ctp",
      "summary": "The hedge benefit ratio in MAR22.23 is not defined when a bucket has no net long and no net short JTD positions, as its denominator is then zero.",
      "impact": "Position: Corporate bucket: long bond on obligor X JTD 75, short equity... fully offset per MAR22.19 so net long 0 and net short 0 in all rating bands; DRC_b = max[0 - HBR*0; 0] Reading a: HBR = 0/0 undefined, DRC_b undefined/error Reading b: treat HBR as any value, 0*HBR = 0, DRC_b = 0 Difference: DRC_b either undefined or 0 (no numeric difference if convention is 0*x)",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
